t\" href=\"./styles.css\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"shell\">\n      <header class=\"hero\">\n        <div class=\"hero-topline\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Public Fabric</p>\n          <span class=\"live-pill\" id=\"live-pill\">Loading catalog…</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <h1 id=\"site-title\">Japer Technology Public Fabric</h1>\n        <p class=\"hero-copy\" id=\"hero-copy\">\n          A living catalog of public repositories published by Japer Technology.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n          <a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://github.com/japer-technology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">\n            View organization\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"button secondary\" href=\"#catalog\">\n            Browse repositories\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n        <dl class=\"stats\">\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <dt>Repositories</dt>\n            <dd id=\"stat-repos\">—</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <dt>First-party</dt>\n            <dd id=\"stat-first-party\">—</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <dt>Forks tracked</dt>\n            <dd id=\"stat-forks\">—</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <dt>Data source</dt>\n            <dd id=\"stat-source\">Loading…</dd>\n          </div>\n        </dl>\n      </header>\n\n      <main>\n        <section class=\"panel intro-panel\">\n          <div class=\"intro-copy-block\">\n            <h2>What this site is for</h2>\n            <p id=\"intro-copy\">\n              This public fabric is meant to become the durable front door for every public Japer Technology repository.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"legend-row\" aria-label=\"Repository status legend\">\n              <span class=\"badge status-active\">Active</span>\n              <span class=\"badge status-featured\">Featured</span>\n              <span class=\"badge status-experimental\">Experimental</span>\n              <span class=\"badge status-watch\">Watching</span>\n              <span class=\"badge status-archived\">Archived</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <aside class=\"callout\">\n            <strong>Maintenance model</strong>\n            <p>\n              The page renders from a local snapshot first, then upgrades to live GitHub data when the API is available.\n              Curated summaries and featured repositories live in <code>data/site.json</code>.\n            </p>\n          </aside>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"panel snapshot-panel\">\n          <div class=\"section-heading\">\n            <h2>Portfolio snapshot</h2>\n            <p>Quick signals for the public repo portfolio, useful before you dive into the full catalog.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"snapshot-grid\">\n            <article class=\"snapshot-card\">\n              <h3>Featured</h3>\n              <p class=\"snapshot-value\" id=\"snapshot-featured\">—</p>\n              <p class=\"snapshot-copy\">Curated repositories prioritized on the page.</p>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"snapshot-card\">\n              <h3>Experimental</h3>\n              <p class=\"snapshot-value\" id=\"snapshot-experimental\">—</p>\n              <p class=\"snapshot-copy\">Repositories currently marked as in-progress or in transition.</p>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"snapshot-card\">\n              <h3>Languages</h3>\n              <p class=\"snapshot-value\" id=\"snapshot-languages\">—</p>\n              <p class=\"snapshot-copy\">Unique implementation languages detected from the repository metadata.</p>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"snapshot-card\">\n              <h3>Total stars</h3>\n              <p class=\"snapshot-value\" id=\"snapshot-stars\">—</p>\n              <p class=\"snapshot-copy\">Combined public star count across the tracked repositories.</p>\n            </article>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"panel\" id=\"featured-section\">\n          <div class=\"section-heading\">\n            <h2>Featured repositories</h2>\n            <p>Start here if you want the shortest path to the most important public work.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"repo-grid featured-grid\" id=\"featured-grid\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"panel\" id=\"catalog\">\n          <div class=\"section-heading\">\n            <h2>Repository catalog</h2>\n            <p>Search, filter, and sort the full public fabric.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"filters\">\n            <label class=\"field field-search\">\n              <span>Search</span>\n              <input id=\"search-input\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search by repo name, summary, topic, or tag\" />\n            </label>\n\n            <label class=\"field compact\">\n              <span>Language</span>\n              <select id=\"language-filter\">\n                <option value=\"all\">All languages</option>\n              </select>\n            </label>\n\n            <label class=\"field compact\">\n              <span>Scope</span>\n              <select id=\"scope-filter\">\n                <option value=\"all\">All repositories</option>\n                <option value=\"first-party\">First-party</option>\n                <option value=\"forks\">Forks only</option>\n                <option value=\"featured\">Featured only</option>\n                <option value=\"experimental\">Experimental only</option>\n              </select>\n            </label>\n\n            <label class=\"field compact\">\n              <span>Sort</span>\n              <select id=\"sort-filter\">\n                <option value=\"updated-desc\">Recently updated</option>\n                <option value=\"stars-desc\">Most stars</option>\n                <option value=\"name-asc\">Name A–Z</option>\n              </select>\n            </label>\n\n            <div class=\"field action-field\">\n              <span>Reset</span>\n              <button class=\"button tertiary\" id=\"reset-filters\" type=\"button\">Clear filters</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <p class=\"results-summary\" id=\"results-summary\" aria-live=\"polite\">Loading repositories…</p>\n          <div class=\"active-filters hidden\" id=\"active-filters\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n          <div class=\"repo-grid\" id=\"repo-grid\"></div>\n          <div class=\"empty-state hidden\" id=\"empty-state\">\n            <h3>No repositories match this filter</h3>\n            <p>Try clearing the search box, switching back to all languages, or widening the scope.</p>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </main>\n\n      <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>\n          Built from <code>.github-minimum-intelligence/public-fabric</code> and deployed by GitHub Actions.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          Curate summaries in <code>data/site.json</code>, then push to <code>main</code> to redeploy.\n        </p>\n      </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <script src=\"./app.js\" defer></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\".github-minimum-intelligence/public-fabric/index.html\",\"content\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>Japer Technology Public Fabric</title>\\n    <meta\\n      name=\\\"description\\\"\\n      content=\\\"A polished GitHub Pages overview of the public repositories published by Japer Technology.\\\"\\n    />\\n    <meta name=\\\"theme-color\\\" content=\\\"#08111f\\\" />\\n    <link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"./styles.css\\\" />\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\\\"shell\\\">\\n      <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n        <div class=\\